(text "ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8  (16 MB flash, 8 MB octal PSRAM)" (at 30.48 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid 2f0daf71-1aa6-416f-8165-3df2f984075c))
(text "EN: 10k / 1uF RC gives a clean power-on reset (Espressif reference).\nBOOT (GPIO0) low at reset = download mode. Native USB on GPIO19/20\nmeans no USB-UART bridge is needed for flashing.\n22uF + 100nF placed at module 3V3 pin." (at 30.48 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid b69fc023-aadf-4ee6-8cf1-73accebff925))
(text "GPIO MAP\nIO1   CC1_SENSE      ADC1_CH0\nIO2   CC2_SENSE      ADC1_CH1\nIO4   VBAT_ADC       ADC1_CH3\nIO5   VBAT_SENSE_EN\nIO7   SD_DET\nIO8   SD_D3\nIO9   IMU_INT1\nIO10  IMU_CS\nIO11  IMU_MOSI\nIO12  IMU_SCLK\nIO13  IMU_MISO\nIO14  SD_CLK\nIO15  SD_CMD\nIO16  SD_D0\nIO17  SD_D1\nIO18  SD_D2\nIO19  USB_D-\nIO20  USB_D+\nIO21  LED_STATUS\nIO38  CHG_N\nIO39  PGOOD_N\nIO40  CHG_EN1\nIO41  CHG_EN2\nIO47  I2C_SDA (Qwiic)\nIO48  I2C_SCL (Qwiic)\nTXD0/RXD0  UART test pads\n\nRESERVED / NC\nIO35-37  used by octal PSRAM (N16R8)\nIO0, IO3, IO45, IO46  strapping pins\n  (IO45 must be low at boot: 3.3V flash)\nADC2 pins avoided: unusable while Wi-Fi runs" (at 246.38 111.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid af0165ab-4533-44a2-a5c1-1364a48d2e24))
)
